{"title":"마슐","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cW6v6/hzXarZMrao/1nQEnlmKWaGtjko5dfivf0&filename=th3","synopsis":"마법보다 근육!!\n\n철저하게 단련한 힘이 모든 마법을 분쇄한다!!\n\n모두가 마법을 사용하고 그 힘의 우열이 모든 것을 결정하는 마법계.\n\n마을과 동떨어진 숲속에서 매일 헬스에 매진하는 소년 마슈의 비밀은 마법을 쓰지 못한다는 것이다.\n\n그 비밀을 타인에게 들켰을 때 일상이 크게 변화한다!!\n\n그리고 무슨 영문인지 마법학교에 입학해서 정상을 노리게 되는데....?!\n\n단련된 근력과 파워로 모든 마법을 분쇄하는 상식 파괴 마법 판타지의 막이 열린다! MASHLE © 2020 by Hajime Komoto/SHUEISHA Inc.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":142,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":234,"change":{"type":"down","amount":92}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":268,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":153,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":113,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":139,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":181,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":154,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":203,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":141,"change":{"type":"up","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":207,"change":{"type":"down","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":232,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-09-13","rank":186,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":134,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":199,"change":{"type":"down","amount":65}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":153,"change":{"type":"up","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":228,"change":{"type":"down","amount":75}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":151,"change":{"type":"up","amount":77}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":109,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":171,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":145,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-09-22","ra